																		Bonjour! Ce commentaire de l&#039;auteur sera entièrement en français. (Not really)
															</div>
				<div class="info">
					<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ihp" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1267048); return false;"  ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1267048&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606921018" alt="Ihp" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1267048)"/></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ihp" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1267048); return false;" >Ihp</a></span> <span class="odate time_1533807249 format_%25e%20%25b%20%25Y%2C%20%25H%3A%25M%7Cagohover">09 Aug 2018 09:34</span>
														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-3904739">
									

<p>So, this has an interesting story behind it&#8212; basically, about a week ago, the user <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-lekter" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3309467); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3309467&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1533811374" alt="Dr Lekter" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3309467)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-lekter" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3309467); return false;">Dr Lekter</a></span> from the French wiki contacted me, saying that the French site had an interest in translating some of my works, as well as basing works off of the translations. I gave them the go-ahead, and immediately started looking for something I could translate in return.</p>
<p>I happened upon the Group of Interest SAPHIR, whose backronym is the least-weird thing about it. It's already been featured in <a href="/scp-3380">SCP-3380</a>, and on the surface, it can be described as a &quot;militant atheist organization&quot; dedicated to wiping out the influence of religion in the world, maintained on the French wiki primarily by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drgemini" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2184104); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2184104&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1533811374" alt="DrGemini" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2184104)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drgemini" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2184104); return false;">DrGemini</a></span>.</p>
<p>That is the tip of the weirdness iceberg.</p>
<p>SAPHIR is more than its simple premise&#8212; DrGemini has done amazing work with SAPHIR, including making up <a href="http://fondationscp.wikidot.com/grenat">an Operations manual</a> for the organization, and writing SCPs which include some rather out-there premises, such as the nine swords of Mohammad (Yes, that one) being the entire reason the Earth is round&#8212; <a href="http://fondationscp.wikidot.com/scp-281-fr">SCP-281-FR</a>, for anyone that's curious. In a word, this Group is Truly, Truly, Outrageous, and I fell in love with the concept.</p>
<p>Right as I was finalizing edits on this, I saw that DrGemini commented on the forum thread for this, so color me giddy. Glad you approve!</p>
<p>Thanks to all those who critiqued it, which includes but is not limited to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/othellothecat" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3213383); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3213383&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1533811374" alt="OthellotheCat" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3213383)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/othellothecat" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3213383); return false;">OthellotheCat</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/uraniumempire" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1613974); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1613974&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1533811374" alt="UraniumEmpire" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1613974)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/uraniumempire" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1613974); return false;">UraniumEmpire</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/wazikamawata" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(651680); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=651680&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1533811374" alt="Wazikamawata" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=651680)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/wazikamawata" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(651680); return false;">Wazikamawata</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mibu-asguard" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3880444); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3880444&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1533811374" alt="Mibu Asguard" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3880444)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mibu-asguard" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3880444); return false;">Mibu Asguard</a></span> and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/alan-stock" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2813598); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2813598&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1533811374" alt="Alan Stock" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2813598)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/alan-stock" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2813598); return false;">Alan Stock</a></span>. Thanks to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/voct" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(392303); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=392303&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1533811374" alt="Voct" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=392303)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/voct" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(392303); return false;">Voct</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-lekter" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3309467); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3309467&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1533811374" alt="Dr Lekter" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3309467)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-lekter" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3309467); return false;">Dr Lekter</a></span> and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drgemini" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2184104); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2184104&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1533811374" alt="DrGemini" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2184104)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drgemini" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2184104); return false;">DrGemini</a></span> for helping me with French translation issues throughought my research on SAPHIR, and to Gemini for giving this their blessing.</p>
<p>Image derived from: <a href="https://pixabay.com/p-312696/?no_redirect">https://pixabay.com/p-312696/?no_redirect</a></p>
<p>For those of you curious, I can't find an exact translation on the text (Latin is a tricky language), but if I wrote it right, I'm pretty sure SAPHIR's Latin motto reads &quot;Fear our Luster&quot;.</p>
